# Specify the base Cohere North model
FROM north-mini-code-1.0

# Pin the context size to 262,144 tokens 
PARAMETER num_ctx 262144

# Temperature adjustment for structural coding precision and agent stability
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40

# Prevent premature truncation of complex code blocks or thinking logs
PARAMETER num_predict 4096

# Crucial System Prompt to activate North's agentic scaffolds and native tool-handling
SYSTEM """You are North Mini Code, an advanced agentic software engineering assistant. You operate using interleaved thinking. Always reason through complex architectural decisions, dependency trees, and edge cases inside a systematic line of thought before generating functional, production-grade code or executing tools. Format tool definitions cleanly as JSON schemas when requested."""